The rated throughput of PCI is 133 MB/s.  An interesting point is that
DEC is moving to PCI for all future Alpha workstations - no more
Turbochannel.  I have this on excellent authority both from our local DEC
resellers, and Kubota.  Kubota has a strong relationship with DEC, and is
providing the top-end 3D graphics engines for the Alpha workstations.
Their current products are Turbochannel based, but future products will
be based on PCI.  They make a nice box, it is field-upgradeable from
an entry level configuration (cost: $25K total) to beyond SGI Reality
Engine levels simply by adding boards.  Good stuff!  :)



