This message implies that the an Abort was recieved before the name list
completed. What OSI card are you using in the OS/2 system? If it is Computrol 
then the link may be timeing out. Take a look at the default transport 
template on the Ultrix system. The Keepalive timer should be set to about
5 sec, not the default of 60.

