I'll make a wild guess. Some systems (such as SPARCstations) send
a spin-up command to the disk when it is ready to bring it online.
Some don't. If the disk has been jumpered not to spinup until
ordered, and the system doesn't send the command, you'll get the
symptoms you describe.

Check the jumpers on the drive and set it to spinup immediately
on power-up, that might work.

Steve

