>
>We have code in both fortran and C, and when we call a c routine from
>fortran we get exactly this message.  I figured it was a pointer
>alignment problem (since we pass pointers to the C routine, fortran
>remember?) but is there a way to solve this?
>
>Thanks for any and all help!
>
>bruce
