exceptions and traps on a DEC Alpha running OSF/1.3.

Suffice it to say that it appears that either I'm totally blowing it or
else somebody at DEC is.  (I strongly suspect that it's me.)

For the life of me, and cannot seem to generate invalid operation exceptions
(*or* traps) when manipulating sNaNs on the Alpha under OSF/1.3.

